# Bambuser

> Bambuser is the leading enterprise video commerce platform. Founded in Sweden in 2007 (pioneering the world's first mobile live stream), Bambuser helps the world's most iconic brands and retailers replace static e-commerce with immersive, high-converting video experiences. Its modular products — Live Shopping, Shoppable Video, Video Consultation, and Live Chat — embed directly into a brand's website and apps, turning video into the structured data backbone for the agentic future of commerce.

Key facts:

- Company: Bambuser AB (publicly listed in Sweden), operating since 2007.
- Scale: 350+ clients worldwide, available in 240 countries, 500m+ GMV generated for customers.
- Customers include L'Oréal, LVMH, Dior, NET-A-PORTER, Hugo Boss, Victoria Beckham, Decathlon, Currys, Sonos, LEGO, Clarins, and Bloomingdale's.
- Products are embeddable on websites and native iOS/Android apps, with integrations for Shopify, Salesforce, Magento, BigCommerce, Wix, and major social channels.
